this proposal, but with a new method instead: godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/9341)\r\n\r\nThis PR aims to add a new method for `PhysicsDirectSpaceState` (2D and 3D), that retrieves shape rest info from all contacts, with the ability to limit the number of results returned. This needs to be implemented with Godod Physics 3D, 2D, and Jolt Physics.\r\n\r\nCurrently there is no method for checking a shape's intersections in a space and getting detailed information about all contacts, which I think is an important feature to have. Ideally, this is how the `PhysicsDirectSpaceState.get_rest_info` method should work, since if you want only one result to be returned, you can limit the number of results returned to 1 with the `max_results` parameter of this proposed new method, and you get the same result as `PhysicsDirectSpaceState.get_rest_info`, which can only return one.  To avoid breaking compatibility though, this has to be a new method.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","descripti